1
00:00:03,151 --> 00:00:10,551
Read your day on the dashboard — Home ▸ Dashboard — What each tile counts, and how to jump from a number to the work behind it.

2
00:00:17,833 --> 00:00:22,065
Home ▸ Dashboard is where the day starts: the practice at a glance.

3
00:00:22,065 --> 00:00:30,547
Each tile counts something live — today’s appointments, active patients, open tasks, revenue this month.

4
00:00:30,547 --> 00:00:36,720
These are not a report you run. They are the current state, and they move as the day does.

5
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:45,315
Every card on the dashboard opens the module behind it — one click, no navigation.

6
00:00:45,315 --> 00:00:58,621
You land in the module itself, ready to work rather than to read.

7
00:00:58,621 --> 00:01:05,302
Quick Actions starts the jobs you do most — a patient, an appointment, a claim — without hunting for the module.

8
00:01:05,302 --> 00:01:10,331
That is the habit: read the tiles at the start of the day, then click the one that needs you.

9
00:01:10,430 --> 00:01:21,730
What you just did

10
00:01:22,313 --> 00:01:31,313
